  ui.sheet('邀请同行伙伴',`<div class="room-invite-page"><div class="room-invite-intro"><div><h3>把下一站，发给朋友。</h3><p>复制这张邀请票的链接，请伙伴一起定下旅程。</p></div><span>${current.members.length} 位伙伴已在房间</span></div><section class="invite-pass" aria-label="${esc(current.title)}的旅行邀请票"><div class="invite-pass-main"><span class="invite-pass-brand">下一站 <small>· 旅行房间</small></span><div class="invite-pass-center"><span>一起去旅行</span><strong>${esc(current.title)}</strong><p>打开邀请链接，填写昵称就能加入。</p></div><span class="invite-pass-bottom">${current.members.length} 位同行伙伴 <span class="invite-pass-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span> 下一站等你</span></div><div class="invite-pass-stub" aria-hidden="true"><span>ROOM<br>PASS</span><i class="invite-pass-barcode"></i><small>一起出发</small></div></section>${secret?`<div class="invite-link-block"><label for="room-invite">邀请链接</label><div class="invite-link-control"><input id="room-invite" type="text" readonly value="${esc(link)}"><button class="primary" data-room-action="copy-invite">${ui.icon('copy')}复制链接</button></div><p>链接只发给同行伙伴；持有链接的人都可以加入。</p></div>`:'<div class="invite-link-empty">当前浏览器没有保存邀请链接。重新生成后即可复制分享。</div>'}${!current.plan?`<div class="invite-plan-note"><div><strong>还没有共享行程</strong><p>你的个人草稿同步后，伙伴才能看到路线。</p></div>${ui.activePlan()?`<button class="secondary" data-room-action="select-publish-room" data-id="${activeId}">同步我的行程</button>`:'<button class="secondary" data-action="plan-library">选择行程</button>'}</div>`:''}<div class="invite-renew-row"><p>重新生成后，旧链接会失效；已加入的伙伴不受影响。</p><button class="text-button" data-room-action="rotate-invite">${ui.icon('refresh-cw')}重新生成链接</button></div></div>`);
